<h2 class="bde-heading-506-115 bde-heading">
How Much Are the Clippers Paying Brandon Ingram in 2026-27?
</h2><div class="bde-fancy-container-506-116 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-fancy-container-506-139 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-f-text-506-151 bde-f-text">
<p>Ingram earns <strong>$40m</strong> in 2026-27, second on the <a href="/teams/los-angeles-clippers/">Clippers</a> payroll after Toronto traded him to Los Angeles in September as part of the Kawhi Leonard deal. It is the second year of the three-year extension he signed with the Raptors, and up from <strong>$38.1m</strong> last season.</p>
<p>His career earnings come to <strong>$260.17m</strong> across eleven seasons. The salary is <strong>22.11%</strong> of the club’s <strong>$180.92m</strong> payroll.</p>

