<h2 class="bde-heading-506-117 bde-heading">
How Much Is Brandon Ingram’s Contract Worth?
</h2><div class="bde-fancy-container-506-118 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-fancy-container-506-141 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-f-text-506-154 bde-f-text">
<p>Ingram signed a three-year extension worth <strong>$120m</strong> with Toronto in 2025, all of it guaranteed. The Raptors traded him to the Clippers on September 14, 2026, and the contract moved with him.</p>
<p>The final season is a player option. He would reach free agency in 2028 at 30.</p>

