</div>
</div><div class="bde-f-text-506-156 bde-f-text">
<p>Ingram’s net worth is estimated at around <strong>$104.07m</strong>, taken from his <strong>$260.17m</strong> in career earnings. One outlet puts him at <strong>$12m</strong>, which is under a twentieth of what he has been paid and far below his earnings record.</p>
<p>He played one season at Duke and the <a href="/teams/los-angeles-lakers/">Lakers</a> took him second overall in 2016, two months before he turned 19.</p>

