<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/brandon-ingram/#faq","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/brandon-ingram/"},"mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Are the Clippers Paying Brandon Ingram in 2026-27?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Ingram earns $40m in 2026-27, second on the Clippers payroll after Toronto traded him to Los Angeles in September as part of the Kawhi Leonard deal. It is the second year of the three-year extension he signed with the Raptors, and up from $38.1m last season. His career earnings come to $260.17m across eleven seasons. The salary is 22.11% of the club’s $180.92m payroll."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What’s Next for Brandon Ingram Beyond 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"One more season follows this one at the Clippers, a player option on 2027-28. Declining it would put him in free agency at 30."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Does Brandon Ingram Earn Over Time?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A $40m season is hard to picture, so here's what it comes to over smaller stretches of time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Is Brandon Ingram’s Contract Worth?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Ingram signed a three-year extension worth $120m with Toronto in 2025, all of it guaranteed. The Raptors traded him to the Clippers on September 14, 2026, and the contract moved with him. The final season is a player option. He would reach free agency in 2028 at 30."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Is Brandon Ingram’s Net Worth?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Ingram’s net worth is estimated at around $104.07m, taken from his $260.17m in career earnings. One outlet puts him at $12m, which is under a twentieth of what he has been paid and far below his earnings record. He played one season at Duke and the Lakers took him second overall in 2016, two months before he turned 19."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why Do the Clippers Pay Brandon Ingram $40m?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Ingram is paid $40m because Toronto traded for him in 2025 and extended him immediately, which is what a club does when it gives up assets for a player. The Clippers took on that contract when they acquired him for Kawhi Leonard. He has been paid by four clubs in eleven seasons."}}]}</script>
